BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:HPC Desktops — A Different Kind of Interactive Supercomputing - 
 Robert Henschel [Cendio]
DTSTART;TZID=US/Mountain:20260310T130000
DTEND;TZID=US/Mountain:20260310T132500
DTSTAMP:20261020T211059Z
UID:pretalx-good-2026-KRZGQ9@pretalx.com
DESCRIPTION:Imagine having access to a centrally hosted environment that c
 ombines the power of HPC systems with the convenience of desktops. This is
  the HPC Desktop\, designed to lower the barrier of entry and broaden adop
 tion of HPC systems.
LOCATION:Main Hall
URL:https://pretalx.com/good-2026/talk/KRZGQ9/
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Supporting Interactive Graphical Applications with Open OnDemand\,
  on Premise and in Azure - Xavier Pillons [Microsoft]\, Robert Henschel [C
 endio]
DTSTART;TZID=US/Mountain:20260310T153000
DTEND;TZID=US/Mountain:20260310T170000
DTSTAMP:20261020T211059Z
UID:pretalx-good-2026-UDNQYU@pretalx.com
DESCRIPTION:This BoF brings together users and resource providers that are
  interested in running interactive graphical applications in Open OnDemand
 . This can be web applications like Jupyter Notebooks or desktop applicati
 ons like RStudio\, Matlab or Visual Studio Code.
LOCATION:Main Hall
URL:https://pretalx.com/good-2026/talk/UDNQYU/
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Supporting Interactive Graphical Applications with ThinLinc in Ope
 n OnDemand - Robert Henschel [Cendio]\, Mattias Reuterskiöld [Cendio]
DTSTART;TZID=US/Mountain:20260311T153000
DTEND;TZID=US/Mountain:20260311T155500
DTSTAMP:20261020T211059Z
UID:pretalx-good-2026-TDP7YW@pretalx.com
DESCRIPTION:This session will introduce ThinLinc and how to use it togethe
 r with Open OnDemand. ThinLinc is a Linux terminal server solution that is
  used at HPC centers around the world to support access to interactive gra
 phical Linux applications. The ThinLinc team is working with the OOD team 
 to integrate ThinLinc into OOD and this session will go over the technical
  work as well as the features of the integration. This session will also i
 nclude a demo of the current beta release.
LOCATION:Main Hall
URL:https://pretalx.com/good-2026/talk/TDP7YW/
END:VEVENT
END:VCALENDAR
